<p>While shrouded in cursed miasma you gain stealth (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> power) and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">40, 54, 65, 74, 82</acronym> physical power.</p><p>The stealth power and physical power will increase with your mindpower.</p>